## Comparison: Gemini CLI vs Claude Code Implementation

### 1. Functionality Gaps

#### **Features Claude Code has that Gemini lacks:**

| Feature | Description | Claude Code | Gemini |
|---------|-------------|-------------|--------|
| **Transcript truncation** | `TruncateAtUUID()`, `FindCheckpointUUID()` for rewind operations | ✅ `transcript.go:176-222` | ❌ Missing |
| **Subagent/Task checkpoints** | Pre/PostToolUse[Task], PostToolUse[TodoWrite] hooks | ✅ `hooks.go:28-29` | ❌ Missing |
| **Subagent token aggregation** | `CalculateTotalTokenUsage()` includes subagent tokens | ✅ `transcript.go:412-449` | ❌ Missing |
| **Transcript serialization** | `SerializeTranscript()` to write back JSONL | ✅ `transcript.go:72-83` | ❌ Missing |
| **Spawned agent extraction** | `ExtractSpawnedAgentIDs()` from Task tool results | ✅ `transcript.go:321-384` | ❌ Missing |
| **Metadata deny rule** | Prevents agent from reading `.entire/metadata/**` | ✅ `hooks.go:37-38` | ❌ Missing |
| **Repo root detection** | `DetectPresence()` uses repo root, not CWD | ✅ `claude.go:44-64` | ❌ Bug - uses CWD only |
| **Cache creation tokens** | Tracks `CacheCreationInputTokens` separately | ✅ `types.go:78` | ❌ Only has `Cached` |

#### **Features Gemini has that Claude Code lacks:**

| Feature | Description | Gemini | Claude Code |
|---------|-------------|--------|-------------|
| **More hook types** | BeforeModel, AfterModel, BeforeToolSelection, PreCompress, Notification | ✅ `hooks.go:21-31` | ❌ N/A |
| **All prompts extraction** | `ExtractAllUserPrompts()` | ✅ `transcript.go:129-148` | ❌ Only last prompt |
